  "title": "Restaurant-Style Potato Skins",
  "description": "Three different cooking techniques--microwaving, frying, then baking--takes these potatoes to serving stage ...but the crunchy, cheese-y results make it worth the wait.",
  "authors": [
    "Misty Risner"
  ],
